{
  "description": "Extra phrasings for OTHER requirements. 'extend' adds evidence patterns to a built-in capability by name; 'add' defines a new capability (trigger matches the job requirement, evidence matches a CV sentence); an 'add' whose name already exists widens that capability instead of duplicating it. Patterns are case-insensitive regular expressions. Every match stays flagged for human review.",
